# Wooden balcony (one-way; top 5 px = walking surface, like oneway_sign):
# k-outlined handrail o/O/l, a flower box O/l with geraniums (p blooms with
# R shade, g/G leaves; no r fill), carved boards oOOl with pointed ends.
# Open ends get a k end board. Opaque: gaps show the whitewashed wall w,
# because a balcony cell replaces a wall_village_bg cell of the house.
# Autotiled (D-020): anim `auto`, frame = neighbour mask
# (1 = same tile above, 2 = right, 4 = below, 8 = left; level edge = same).
# Only the left/right bits change the look.
sprite = tile_balcony
size   = 16x16
origin = 0,0
anim   = auto frames=16 ticks=1
